- Free ($0) models are served by independent peers on the Antseed P2P network. Availability, quality, latency and privacy are not guaranteed. Requests may be visible to the peer that serves them. Do not send sensitive data.
- 免费模型由 Antseed P2P 网络上的独立节点提供。可用性、输出质量、延迟和隐私均无保证;请求内容可能被提供服务的节点看到,请勿发送敏感数据。
- Some listed models may return errors (e.g. 402 credits required, 404/429/502) or charge fees. The "free" label reflects only the advertised peer price at the time of query.
- 部分模型可能报错(如 402 需充值、404/429/502),或产生费用。"免费"仅指查询时节点公布的报价为 0。
